  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Proxy",
      "items": [
        "Transparent reverse proxy on 127.0.0.1:8788",
        "Fail-open: metering errors can never break the response path",
        "The API key is forwarded, never persisted; prompt bodies are not logged"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Metering",
      "items": [
        "gateway.py is the hub: it calls usage.py, pricing.py and storage.py directly",
        "usage.py and pricing.py never call each other or storage — no module chain",
        "Per-agent attribution via a configurable header (agent_header, default x-watchdog-agent)",
        "Cost is ESTIMATED from a config price table until Cost-API reconciliation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Kept out of the hot path",
      "items": [
        "forecast.py is an offline reader; gateway.py never imports it",
        "timesfm/torch import lazily inside the forecaster, so the gateway never pulls torch",
        "Installed only via the optional 'forecast' extra"
      ]
    }
  ]
